Thou hast been spoiled.

Beware if you find gauntlets of power early!  You can, about 50% of the
time, kick a loadstone, if you're wearing them.  So kick your gray stone
about ten times to be sure.

After donating to a non-aligned priest (Moloch) about 100000 zorkmids, I
zapped a wand of create monster and got a black dragon, with the
intention of sacrificing, converting the altar and killing the priest to
get my cash back.  I knew I wouldn't be able to move the dragon so I
tried to maneuver so the dragon was on the altar.  But the dragon flamed
the priest for me with his disintegration breath.  "Great," I thought.
Saves me the trouble.  But the priest's carcass had *no* items; no
money, no spellbooks, no cloak, nothing!  Is this a bug or restitution?


